<title>USA: SuperGen says stock filing a mistake.</title>
<headline>SuperGen says stock filing a mistake.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAMON, Calif. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SuperGen Inc Thursday said a U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission filing for the sale of 198,000 company common shares by Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Joseph Rubinfield was made in error by PaineWebber Group Inc, and the filing will be rescinded.</p>
<p>Likewise, a filing for the sale of 12,960 shares held by company Vice President Frank Brenner was mistakenly made and will be rescinded.</p>
<p>In a statement, Rubinfeld and Brenner said they have never sold a single share of SuperGen common stock.</p>
</text>
